vcs demo: two people, four branches, every kind of merge, one pack

== a project and its first commit
$ vcs init
Initialized empty repository in .vcs/
  (wrote README.md)
  (wrote src/greet.txt)
  (wrote .vcsignore)
  (wrote src/notes.log)
$ vcs status
On branch main

No commits yet

Untracked files:
    .vcsignore
    README.md
    src/

nothing added to commit but untracked files present
$ vcs add .
add '.vcsignore'
add 'README.md'
add 'src/greet.txt'
$ vcs status --short
A  .vcsignore
A  README.md
A  src/greet.txt
$ vcs commit -m "Start the greeter"
[main (root-commit) 9d65bba] Start the greeter
 3 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

== a feature branch, and main moving on
$ vcs branch feature
$ vcs checkout feature
Switched to branch 'feature'
  (wrote src/greet.txt)
  (wrote src/farewell.txt)
$ vcs diff
diff --git a/src/greet.txt b/src/greet.txt
index 623f471..5f0eaf9 100644
--- a/src/greet.txt
+++ b/src/greet.txt
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 Hello, world!
 How are you today?
 Have a good day.
+See you tomorrow.
$ vcs add src
add 'src/farewell.txt'
add 'src/greet.txt'
$ vcs commit -m "Say goodbye too"
[feature 9f32683] Say goodbye too
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)
$ vcs checkout main
Switched to branch 'main'
  (wrote README.md)
$ vcs add README.md
add 'README.md'
$ vcs commit -m "Describe the greeter"
[main 770c46d] Describe the greeter
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)
$ vcs log --graph --all
* 9f32683 (feature) Say goodbye too
| * 770c46d (HEAD -> main) Describe the greeter
|/
* 9d65bba Start the greeter

== a clean three-way merge
$ vcs merge feature
Merge made by the three-way strategy: bbf0d8e
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)
$ vcs log --graph
*   bbf0d8e (HEAD -> main) Merge branch 'feature'
|\
* | 770c46d Describe the greeter
| * 9f32683 (feature) Say goodbye too
|/
* 9d65bba Start the greeter

== a merge with a conflict, resolved
$ vcs checkout -b polish
Switched to a new branch 'polish'
  (wrote src/greet.txt)
$ vcs add src/greet.txt
add 'src/greet.txt'
$ vcs commit -m "Greet everyone"
[polish 961a62c] Greet everyone
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)
$ vcs checkout main
Switched to branch 'main'
  (wrote src/greet.txt)
$ vcs add src/greet.txt
add 'src/greet.txt'
$ vcs commit -m "Greet friends"
[main b590745] Greet friends
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)
$ vcs merge polish
CONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in src/greet.txt
Automatic merge failed; fix conflicts and then commit the result.
$ vcs status
On branch main
You have unmerged paths.

Unmerged paths:
    both modified:   src/greet.txt
$ cat src/greet.txt
  | <<<<<<< HEAD
  | Hello, friends!
  | =======
  | Hello, everyone!
  | >>>>>>> polish
  | How are you today?
  | Have a good day.
  | See you tomorrow.
$ vcs commit
vcs commit: invalid: unmerged paths must be added first: src/greet.txt
  (wrote src/greet.txt)
$ vcs add src/greet.txt
add 'src/greet.txt'
$ vcs commit
[main 9d78278] Merge branch 'polish'
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

== a fast-forward, and a release tagged
$ vcs checkout -b docs
Switched to a new branch 'docs'
  (wrote CHANGES.md)
$ vcs add CHANGES.md
add 'CHANGES.md'
$ vcs commit -m "Keep a changelog"
[docs 091d092] Keep a changelog
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)
$ vcs checkout main
Switched to branch 'main'
$ vcs merge docs
Updating 9d78278..091d092
Fast-forward
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)
$ vcs tag -m "The first release" v1.0
$ vcs branch
  docs
  feature
* main
  polish
$ vcs branch -d feature
Deleted branch feature (was 9f32683).
$ vcs log -n 2
commit 091d0929b792754cb6c3e4ff11d1a5c4c8f9ad65 (HEAD -> main, tag: v1.0, docs)
Author: Grace Hopper <grace@example.org>
Date:   Sat Nov 21 10:09:00 2026 +0100

    Keep a changelog

commit 9d782782b1fb8869e4cb22431a18dde656202a6a
Merge: b590745 961a62c
Author: Ada Lovelace <ada@example.org>
Date:   Sat Nov 21 10:08:00 2026 +0100

    Merge branch 'polish'
$ vcs log --graph
* 091d092 (HEAD -> main, tag: v1.0, docs) Keep a changelog
*   9d78278 Merge branch 'polish'
|\
* | b590745 Greet friends
| * 961a62c (polish) Greet everyone
|/
*   bbf0d8e Merge branch 'feature'
|\
* | 770c46d Describe the greeter
| * 9f32683 Say goodbye too
|/
* 9d65bba Start the greeter

== the objects are git's
git hash-object: agrees on 4 objects, a blob, a tree, a commit, a tag

== packed, checked, and read back
$ vcs gc
Packed 32 objects (15 as deltas) into pack-4165996ec8ab...
Removed 32 loose objects and 0 old packs; 0 unreachable objects left loose
$ vcs fsck
Checked 32 objects, in 1 pack and loose files: every hash agrees with its content and every reference is there
$ vcs log --oneline --all
091d092 (HEAD -> main, tag: v1.0, docs) Keep a changelog
9d78278 Merge branch 'polish'
b590745 Greet friends
961a62c (polish) Greet everyone
bbf0d8e Merge branch 'feature'
770c46d Describe the greeter
9f32683 Say goodbye too
9d65bba Start the greeter
$ vcs diff HEAD~2 HEAD~1
diff --git a/src/greet.txt b/src/greet.txt
index 6fe5e67..3a086fa 100644
--- a/src/greet.txt
+++ b/src/greet.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-Hello, friends!
+Hello, friends and everyone!
 How are you today?
 Have a good day.
 See you tomorrow.
$ vcs cat-file -p v1.0
object 091d0929b792754cb6c3e4ff11d1a5c4c8f9ad65
type commit
tag v1.0
tagger Ada Lovelace <ada@example.org> 1795252260 +0100

The first release

== a damaged object found
  (moved the loose object 2dd8f60 to the name 3e93e06)
$ vcs fsck
vcs fsck: invalid: error: 3e93e06750101655545e1d4167041fcd346765a0: the loose object 3e93e06750101655545e1d4167041fcd346765a0 holds the content of 2dd8f602c885254e76f0ef33b98bae1769581848
Checked 33 objects, in 1 pack and loose files: 1 problem found
  (removed 3e93e06)
$ vcs status
On branch main

nothing to commit, working tree clean

demo folder removed
